  "usage": [
    "Use 金色 to describe something that is gold-coloured or has a golden shine. 佢隻戒指係金色。",
    "It is common with objects, clothes, and decorations. 呢條裙係金色。",
    "You can use it for real gold or for a gold-like colour. 呢個獎盃係金色嘅。",
    "It is often used in everyday speech to talk about a bright, rich colour tone. 夕陽睇落好金色。"
  ],
  "examples": [
